monarch-the-endless\" target=\"_blank\">Monarch: The Endless</a> You are an alien ruler, charged with maintaining a people who you shape to suit your needs.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7015-almarck","name":"Almarck","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-25T15:30:29-07:00","id":899460,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Almarck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/899269-dark-eras-is-here-for-all?p=899298#post899298\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What are the settings for everyone again? I'll have to wait a day or so before I can obtain it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Let's see<br /> <br /> Sundered World (werewolves &amp; mages in the Neolithic Balkans)<br /> <br /> To the Strongest (Mages at the birth of the Diamond Orders in Alexander's Empire)<br /> <br /> Three Kingdoms Darkness (Changeling and Geist in 3 Kingdoms China)<br /> <br /> Wolf and the Raven (werewolves and Geist Vikings)<br /> <br /> After the Fall (Demons in Istanbul right after the fall of Constantinople)<br /> <br /> Beneath the Skin (skinthieves and demons in the Aztec Empire)<br /> <br /> Requiem for Regina (vampire and changeling in Elizabethan England)<br /> <br /> Falling Blossoms (Hunter in Edo Japan)<br /> <br /> Lily, Sabre, Sword (Changeling in Swashbuckling 17th Century France)<br /> <br /> Doubting Souls (Hunter in colonial Salem)<br /> <br /> Grimm Dark Era (Changeling in 19th Century Germany)<br /> <br /> Ruins of Empire (Mummy during turn of the century British Egyptology)<br /> <br /> Handful of Dust (Promethean during the Depression/Dustbowl)<br /> <br /> God's Own Country (Geist in 1950s New Zealand)<br /> <br /> Out in the Cold (Demon in Cold War Berlin)<br /> <br /> Bowery Dogs (1970s punk Werewolf)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-25T15:39:54-07:00","id":899469,"title":"","content":"There are going to be 10 more eras in the Companion (so many got funded they had to break it into two books).<br /> <br /> Cleopatra Mummy<br /> Forsaken by Rome (Werewolf)<br /> Black Death (Vampire and Promethean)<br /> Roanoke Colony (Geist)<br /> Mutapa Empire (Mummy and Mage)<br /> 30 Years War (Promethean)<br /> Year Without a Summer (Promethean)<br /> Age of Spiritualism (Second Sight)<br /> Reconstruction Beast<br /> Russian Revolution Demon","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 05-25-2016, 06:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\u