, literally four posts above milo v3's comment, I repeated the situation. And then they asked what was going on, and I'm just sitting here like. Am I typing this out for my own amusement?</div> </div> </div> </div> I've heard nothing, but good things about the writing, just a few issues with the mechanics in the ones in the process of transitioning from 1e to 2e.<br /> <br /> So barring disaster, I'm going to get it on the 30th.<br /> <br /> Once I have it, I'll figure things out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-27T17:31:17-07:00","id":901553,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hm8453a</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/899269-dark-eras-is-here-for-all?p=901107#post901107\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Sometimes, I feel like I'm talking to myself.<br /> <br /> I've addressed this. I've done it here, and in other threads.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">I got pissed in my last post because in this same thread, literally four posts above milo v3's comment, I repeated the situation. And then they asked what was going on, and I'm just sitting here like. Am I typing this out for my own amusement?</span> </div> </div> </div>You have misinterpreted my post.<br /> <br /> I read that (I also read your posts in earlier threads on the subject). I actually only worded my post in the way I did because I was aware that you used the structure you were told with the contracts and everything. It doesn't actually answer why they told different people different things, so I wonder at the chain of events that lead to that. I'm aware your getting annoyed by people talking about it, but I was not asking you why you did what you did. If I was I wouldn't have talked about the other eras. I'm curious as the the chain of events that lead you to be told what you were told, since it seems different from what other people were told.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":8331,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","user":"milo v3","date":". 05-27-2016, 08:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-27T19:24:04-07:00","id":901652,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/899269-dark-eras-is-here-for-all?p=901553#post901553\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You have misinterpreted my post.<br /> <br /> I read that (I also read your posts in earlier threads on the subject). I actually only worded my post in the way I did because I was aware that you used the structure you were told with the contracts and everything. It doesn't actually answer why they told different people different things, so I wonder at the chain of events that lead to that. I'm aware your getting annoyed by people talking about it, but I was not asking you why you did what you did. If I was I wouldn't have talked about the other eras. I'm curious as the the chain of events that lead you to be told what you were told, since it seems different from what other people were told.</div> </div> </div> </div>As far as I know, there were different devs.<br /> <br /> And I'm not annoyed people are talking about it, I'm annoyed the question was asked four posts after I thought I had answered.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":3093,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","user":"hm8453a","date":". 05-27-2016, 11:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-27T19:50:08-07:00","id":901665,"title":"","content":"How good is the Three Kingdoms section?<br /> EDIT<br /> I guess people are going to say &quot;very good&quot;, so before that:<br /> How is the historical setting utilized and how are Changelings/Geists &quot;made work&quot; in it? What is emphasized?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":9102,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","user":"WHW","date":". 05-27-2016, 10:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","name":"WHW","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2542"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-27T20:03:30-07:00","id":901672,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WHW</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/899269-dark-eras-is-here-for-all?p=901665#post901665\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How good is the Three Kingdoms section?</div> </div> </div> </div>It certainly didn't hook me like some of the others, and it's definitely not a crossover setting; you get some Geist stuff and some Changeling stuff with very little overlap. The Changeling section is notable because it gives us the Directional Courts (and I don't think the Central Court was originally detailed, so that's new) which I've always enjoyed. <br /> <br /> It's kind of a bummer to me that most of the 'crossover' Eras aren't really that at all; they mostly just detail the setting and then give you separate material for both lines. While this makes sense for the Elizabethan Changeling stuff (being added later as a stretch goal), I wish more was done to merge the others.<br /> <br /> My personal favorites in the book are definitely To The Strongest, The Sundered World, Beneath The Skin, and After The Fall. I'm really, really looking forward to the Companion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-28T08:43:48-07:00","id":902069,"title":"","content":"Hmm. That sounds little troubling. I'm not very interested in rest of the eras, so I wanted to buy it for the Three Kingdoms thing to bait my group into trying out Geists and Changelings, but it seems that it's not really worth it (not more than just doing our own research, which...is done anyway). Was it written with assistance of a sinologist?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","name":"WHW","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2542"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-28T11:36:24-07:00","id":902179,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WHW</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/899269-dark-eras-is-here-for-all?p=902069#post902069\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmm. That sounds little troubling. I'm not very interested in rest of the eras, so I wanted to buy it for the Three Kingdoms thing to bait my group into trying out Geists and Changelings, but it seems that it's not really worth it (not more than just doing our own research, which...is done anyway). Was it written with assistance of a sinologist?</div> </div> </div> </div>Like I said, I haven't really given it a proper read-through. I know folks in the Geist firum enjoyed it a lot, and the art in the chapter is pretty fantastic. <br /> <br /> No clue on the credentials of the authors.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-28T13:14:49-07:00","id":902253,"title":"","content":"Er, misprint, I think:<br /> <br /> In the text of the Skinthief Merit, it's said that you can only refresh a Willpower from Vice once a session.<br /> <br /> Unless I'm misrembering, I think you can refresh once a SCENE from Vice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-28T16:49:27-07:00","id":902367,"title":"","content":"The errata changes also introduced some new errors. On page 40 &quot;eleven feet tall&quot; is now &quot;eleven feetl&quot;, and in the &quot;Beneath the Skin&quot; chapter, the footers lost some i's. &quot;Capulli&quot; became &quot;Capull&quot; and &quot;Tonalpohualli&quot; became &quot;Tonalpohuall&quot;.<br /> <br /> I know this isn't going to be changed at this point, but still. It always feels strange when new errors are introduced when fixing old ones.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/304-penta","name":"Penta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar304_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"617"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}